  The draft's reel_script and caption say the minister's speech told students that 'knowledge and celebrations are both important' is paraphrased loosely; the article says celebrations and education are equally important, which is consistent, but the caption's sentence 'கொண்டாட்டமும் கல்வியும் இரண்டும் முக்கியம்' is ungrammatical and unclear in Tamil.
  The draft's reel_script omits that the minister mentioned attending college celebrations himself, wearing silk veshti at the Parambikulam Aliyar canal opening, and that the minister's own mention of his silk dress for this event is missing; the article also says the minister wore silk dress at this event, which the draft omits.
  The draft's slides_spec and reel_script say the Chennai Central railway station setup was 'போன்ற அமைப்பில்' a replica, which is an accurate description, but the slides line 'ரிக்ஷா வண்டி போன்ற செட்டில் மாணவர்கள் செல்பி' does not mention Chennai Central station, a detail present in the article.
  The draft's headline calls the institution 'கேஎஸ்ஆர் கல்லூரி' (a single college) while the article describes KSR educational institutions with 16+ colleges; the headline narrows the scope.
  The caption's '📰 முழு விவரம்' paragraph and 'நவம்பர் 6, 2026' date line: the article gives only 'நவ.6' with no year, so the year 2026 is an added detail (though the posting date rule exempts date-line claims, the caption's section is not footer).
