  reel_script says the event was held 'for children' and that it was about 'பட்டாசு பாதுகாப்பு' in a way that narrows the article's general awareness event; minor, but the headline 'குழந்தைகளுக்கு பட்டாசு' in slides_spec is an overgeneralisation not stated in the article
  reel_script says the Kumarapalayam fire station officer Mohan led the firefighters 'பட்டாசு வெடிக்கும் முறை குறித்து விளக்கினர்' — the article says they explained how to burst crackers to children; acceptable, but the reel_script omits the instruction that children must not wear loose clothing (தளர்வான ஆடைகளை தவிர்த்து) which is an important safety fact from the article
  reel_script omits the attendance/event details that Thalirvidum Bharatham and the fire department ran it together with the headmistress Malarvizhi's welcome and the chairman and secretary presiding; these are missing from the reel but are not critical facts
